{"task_id": "Mbpp/11", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to remove first and last occurrence of a given character from the string.\nassert remove_Occ(\"hello\",\"l\") == \"heo\"\n\"\"\"\ndef remove_Occ(string, char):\n    # Find first and last occurrence indices\n    first_idx = string.find(char)\n    last_idx = string.rfind(char)\n    \n    if first_idx == -1:\n        return string\n    \n    if first_idx == last_idx:\n        return string[:first_idx] + string[first_idx + 1:]\n    \n    result = string[:first_idx] + string[first_idx + 1:last_idx] + string[last_idx + 1:]\n    return result"}
