{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to sort a list of elements.\nassert pancake_sort([15, 79, 25, 38, 69]) == [15, 25, 38, 69, 79]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts array using pancake sort algorithm by repeatedly finding max and flipping.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = arr[:curr_size].index(max(arr[:curr_size]))\n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                arr = flip(arr, max_idx)\n            arr = flip(arr, curr_size - 1)\n    return arr\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to sort a list of elements.\nassert pancake_sort([15, 79, 25, 38, 69]) == [15, 25, 38, 69, 79]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts array using pancake sort algorithm by repeatedly flipping prefixes.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = arr[:curr_size].index(max(arr[:curr_size]))\n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                arr = flip(arr, max_idx)\n            arr = flip(arr, curr_size - 1)\n    return arr\n```"}
