{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to calculate the sum of perrin numbers.\nassert cal_sum(9) == 49\n\"\"\"\ndef cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Generate Perrin sequence: P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3) for n >= 3\n    # Initial values: P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    if n == 2:\n        return 3\n    if n == 3:\n        return 5\n    \n    a, b, c = 3, 0, 2\n    total = 5  # sum of first 3 perrin numbers\n    \n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_perrin = a + b\n        total += next_perrin\n        a, b, c = b, c, next_perrin\n    \n    return total"}
