{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to calculate the sum of perrin numbers.\nassert cal_sum(9) == 49\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # First three Perrin numbers\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    if n == 2:\n        return 3\n    if n == 3:\n        return 5\n    \n    # Generate Perrin sequence and calculate sum\n    a, b, c = 3, 0, 2  # P(0), P(1), P(2)\n    total = 3  # P(0) = 3\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if i == 1:\n            total += 0  # P(1) = 0\n        elif i == 2:\n            total += 2  # P(2) = 2\n        else:\n            next_perrin = a + b  # P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3)\n            total += next_perrin\n            a, b, c = b, c, next_perrin\n    \n    return total\n```"}
