{"task_id": "Mbpp/576", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to check whether a list is sublist of another or not.\nassert is_Sub_Array([1,4,3,5],[1,2]) == False\n\"\"\"\ndef is_Sub_Array(main_list, sub_list):\n    \"\"\"Check if sub_list is a sublist of main_list.\"\"\"\n    if not sub_list:\n        return True\n    \n    for i in range(len(main_list) - len(sub_list) + 1):\n        if main_list[i:i + len(sub_list)] == sub_list:\n            return True\n    \n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/576", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to check whether a list is sublist of another or not.\nassert is_Sub_Array([1,4,3,5],[1,2]) == False\n\"\"\"\ndef is_Sub_Array(main_list, sub_list):\n    \"\"\"Check if sub_list is a contiguous subarray of main_list.\"\"\"\n    if len(sub_list) == 0:\n        return True\n    if len(sub_list) > len(main_list):\n        return False\n    \n    for i in range(len(main_list) - len(sub_list) + 1):\n        if main_list[i:i + len(sub_list)] == sub_list:\n            return True\n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/577", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the last digit in factorial of a given number.\nassert last_Digit_Factorial(4) == 4\n\"\"\"\ndef last_Digit_Factorial(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the last digit of n factorial.\"\"\"\n    if n >= 5:\n        return 0\n    \n    factorial = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        factorial *= i\n    \n    return factorial % 10"}
