{"task_id": "Mbpp/622", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the median of two sorted lists of same size.\nassert get_median([1, 12, 15, 26, 38], [2, 13, 17, 30, 45], 5) == 16.0\n\"\"\"\ndef get_median(arr1, arr2, n):\n    \"\"\"Find median of two sorted arrays of same size.\"\"\"\n    merged = []\n    i = j = 0\n    \n    while i < n and j < n:\n        if arr1[i] <= arr2[j]:\n            merged.append(arr1[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            merged.append(arr2[j])\n            j += 1\n    \n    while i < n:\n        merged.append(arr1[i])\n        i += 1\n    \n    while j < n:\n        merged.append(arr2[j])\n        j += 1\n    \n    return (merged[n-1] + merged[n]) / 2.0"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/622", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the median of two sorted lists of same size.\nassert get_median([1, 12, 15, 26, 38], [2, 13, 17, 30, 45], 5) == 16.0\n\"\"\"\ndef get_median(list1, list2, n):\n    \"\"\"Find median of two sorted lists of same size.\"\"\"\n    merged = []\n    i = j = 0\n    \n    while i < n and j < n:\n        if list1[i] <= list2[j]:\n            merged.append(list1[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            merged.append(list2[j])\n            j += 1\n    \n    while i < n:\n        merged.append(list1[i])\n        i += 1\n    \n    while j < n:\n        merged.append(list2[j])\n        j += 1\n    \n    total_length = 2 * n\n    return (merged[total_length // 2 - 1] + merged[total_length // 2]) / 2.0"}
