{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the last position of an element in a sorted array.\nassert last([1,2,3],1) == 0\n\"\"\"\ndef last(arr, target):\n    \"\"\"Find the last position of target element in sorted array.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n    \n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            left = mid + 1\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    \n    return result"}
